      ],
      "text": "1. Treatment of drug-susceptible TB using a 6-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        210.4459228515625,
        142.0666961669922,
        235.2409210205078
      ],
      "text": "regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        246.78114318847656,
        228.62290954589844,
        267.6611328125
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 1.1",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        279.36651611328125,
        203.97349548339844,
        293.72149658203125
      ],
      "text": "No. Recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        300.98114013671875,
        513.3594360351562,
        315.33612060546875
      ],
      "text": "1.1 New patients with pulmonary TB should receive a regimen containing 6 months",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        312.98114013671875,
        243.75389099121094,
        327.33612060546875
      ],
      "text": "of rifampicin: 2HRZE/4HR",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.48127746582031,
        329.2330322265625,
        378.925537109375,
        343.5880126953125
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, high certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        360.4635314941406,
        119.47928619384766,
        376.3155212402344
      ],
      "text": "Remarks",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.4134216308594,
        527.4680786132812,
        397.9664306640625
      ],
      "text": "A : The recommendation also applies to extrapulmonary TB ­– except TB of the central nervous system,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.971512794494629,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        396.7234191894531,
        383.96685791015625,
        411.16644287109375
      ],
      "text": "bone or joint, for which some expert groups suggest longer therapy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        418.31732177734375,
        527.4389038085938,
        432.8703308105469
      ],
      "text": "B : WHO recommends that national TB control programmes (NTPs) provide supervision and support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        431.6273193359375,
        384.3804931640625,
        446.0703430175781
      ],
      "text": "for all TB patients, to ensure completion of the full course of therapy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.2213134765625,
        527.5148315429688,
        467.7743225097656
      ],
      "text": "C : WHO recommends drug-resistance surveys (or surveillance) for monitoring the impact of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        466.53131103515625,
        350.17706298828125,
        480.9743347167969
      ],
      "text": "treatment programme, and for designing standard regimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        494.3485107421875,
        220.7113037109375,
        510.20050048828125
      ],
      "text": "Source of recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.408447265625,
        527.401611328125,
        531.8514404296875
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation was first put forward in 2010 and was considered valid in the 2017 guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.4984130859375,
        527.4835815429688,
        545.0513916015625
      ],
      "text": "Annex 1 update (see summary of recommendations in  ). The recommendation is copied without",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        543.8084106445312,
        494.56097412109375,
        558.2514038085938
      ],
      "text": "modification into this consolidated document and appears exactly as in the 2010 guidelines.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        571.6256713867188,
        216.29168701171875,
        587.4777221679688
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        594.6856079101562,
        527.3937377929688,
        609.1286010742188
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review and meta-analysis included 21 472 participants in 312 arms of 57 randomized",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        606.609619140625,
        527.416015625,
        622.32861328125
      ],
      "text": "(7) controlled trials (RCTs) conducted in various regions of the world since 1965  . In three of the 57",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        621.0855712890625,
        527.4411010742188,
        635.528564453125
      ],
      "text": "trials, patients were randomly assigned to either a 2-month rifampicin or a 6-month rifampicin arm;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        634.2855834960938,
        527.4541625976562,
        648.7285766601562
      ],
      "text": "rates of failure, relapse and acquired drug resistance were compared “head-to-head” across the two",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.485595703125,
        527.3751220703125,
        661.9285888671875
      ],
      "text": "study arms. In a multivariate regression analysis, each arm of the 57 trials was treated as a separate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        660.6856079101562,
        490.7967224121094,
        675.1286010742188
      ],
      "text": "cohort and results were adjusted for potentially confounding patient and treatment factors.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        682.3895263671875,
        527.4345092773438,
        696.83251953125
      ],
      "text": "The three studies with head-to-head comparisons showed that the risk of relapse after a 6-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        695.5894775390625,
        527.453125,
        710.032470703125
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin regimen was significantly lower than that after a 2-month rifampicin regimen. If a country",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        708.7894897460938,
        527.1732177734375,
        723.2324829101562
      ],
      "text": "were to change from a 2-month to a 6-month rifampicin regimen, the benefit would be an estimated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.989544868469238,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        721.9896240234375,
        269.0849914550781,
        736.4326171875
      ],
      "text": "112 relapses averted per 1000 TB patients.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        547.8607177734375,
        801.0170288085938,
        551.980712890625,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "7",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}